Unit 401?

24
00:03:50,830 --> 00:03:52,130
They are Master Zhang's people.

25
00:03:53,380 --> 00:03:54,820
Gather everyone here.

26
00:03:55,280 --> 00:03:55,820
Okay.

27
00:04:38,870 --> 00:04:40,170
