63
00:08:10,480 --> 00:08:11,930
Don't come near me.

64
00:08:13,680 --> 00:08:15,170
Don't come near me.

65
00:08:16,190 --> 00:08:17,780
Don't come near me.

66
00:08:18,120 --> 00:08:18,900
Don't come near me.

67
00:08:21,360 --> 00:08:21,900
Master.

68
00:08:22,430 --> 00:08:23,170
Her name is Xu Yuan.

69
00:08:23,830 --> 00:08:24,700
The only survivor in the hospital.

70
00:08:24,800 --> 00:08:25,540
Don't come near me.

71
00:08:25,830 --> 00:08:26,700
She's emotionally unstable right now

72
00:08:27,160 --> 00:08:28,020
and might attack you.

73
00:08:34,630 --> 00:08:35,370
Don't come near me.

74
00:08:35,600 --> 00:08:36,460
Don't come near me!

75
00:08:39,720 --> 00:08:40,580
I won't hurt you.

76
00:08:41,840 --> 00:08:42,850
I'm here to help.

77
00:08:43,840 --> 00:08:44,420
Trust me.

78
00:08:51,670 --> 00:08:53,340
Do you know how they vanished?

79
00:08:57,510 --> 00:08:58,220
Over there.

80
00:09:02,910 --> 00:09:04,650
They suddenly vanished over there.

81
00:09:04,790 --> 00:09:05,730
So sudden.

82
00:09:12,320 --> 00:09:13,730
When did it begin raining?

83
00:09:14,600 --> 00:09:15,770
After dusk.

84
00:09:16,790 --> 00:09:17,940
It was already raining when Unit 401

85
00:09:17,960 --> 00:09:18,820
came here.

86
00:09:19,750 --> 00:09:20,340
But no traces

87
00:09:21,120 --> 00:09:22,250
were left in the hospital.

88
00:09:24,000 --> 00:09:25,300
If they didn't walk in from outside,

89
00:09:27,150 --> 00:09:29,490
they must have crawled up from underground.

90
00:09:32,720 --> 00:09:33,130
Come.

91
00:09:34,720 --> 00:09:36,730
Let's find the secret passage in the hospital.

92
00:11:04,960 --> 00:11:05,910
Pry this plank open.

93
00:11:06,320 --> 00:11:06,820
Yes.

94
00:11:13,880 --> 00:11:14,740
There is indeed a hole.

95
00:11:15,360 --> 00:11:16,930
Did they crawl up from here?

96
00:11:17,070 --> 00:11:19,050
And they covered the hole afterwards?

97
00:11:38,160 --> 00:11:38,620
Master.

98
00:11:39,230 --> 00:11:40,500
The mountain underneath has been completely hollowed out.

99
00:11:40,630 --> 00:11:41,290
This is suspicious.

100
00:11:41,910 --> 00:11:42,890
Let's go down and take a look.

101
00:11:56,060 --> 00:11:57,260
[Zhang Xiaojin, Zhang Qishan's Communication Officer]

102
00:12:01,390 --> 00:12:01,890
A wall?

103
00:12:02,790 --> 00:12:03,180
Master.

104
00:12:03,790 --> 00:12:05,420
Why did someone build a wall here?

105
00:12:07,510 --> 00:12:08,580
The answer is below us.

106
00:12:23,550 --> 00:12:24,060
Master,

107
00:12:25,240 --> 00:12:26,130
I found some traces here.

108
00:12:37,510 --> 00:12:38,890
Probably traces of Unit 401's

109
00:12:39,200 --> 00:12:40,700
ascent and descent.

110
00:12:51,630 --> 00:12:52,610
Following the traces,

111
00:12:53,270 --> 00:12:54,180
Unit 401

112
00:12:55,240 --> 00:12:56,180
walked into the wall?

113
00:13:13,870 --> 00:13:15,010
Master, it doesn't make sense.

114
00:13:15,200 --> 00:13:16,820
Weren't they repairing the moat?

115
00:13:17,390 --> 00:13:19,270
How did they end up going in and out of the wall?

116
00:13:20,240 --> 00:13:21,220
Just smoke and mirrors.

117
00:13:21,840 --> 00:13:23,820
Someone wants me to find this place.

118
00:13:24,000 --> 00:13:25,220
They merely used Unit 401.

119
00:13:27,960 --> 00:13:29,370
Search every corner carefully.

120
00:13:29,550 --> 00:13:30,180
Yes!

121
00:14:07,870 --> 00:14:08,300
Master.

122
00:14:08,600 --> 00:14:09,180
I found something.

123
00:14:49,390 --> 00:14:50,340
Over 400 meters deep.

124
00:14:51,320 --> 00:14:52,370
Over 400 meters deep?

125
00:14:52,630 --> 00:14:54,130
That's even longer than Changsha Thoroughfare.

126
00:14:54,480 --> 00:14:55,300
Who built this?

127
00:14:56,030 --> 00:14:56,980
And what for?

128
00:14:57,510 --> 00:14:59,580
To hide what's on the other side, of course.

129
00:15:32,270 --> 00:15:33,250
So, Unit 401

130
00:15:33,790 --> 00:15:35,300
entered the structure behind the wall?

131
00:15:36,510 --> 00:15:37,730
