132
00:15:40,150 --> 00:15:41,370
The mechanism to open the passage

133
00:15:41,390 --> 00:15:42,940
should be inside the tunnel.

134
00:15:43,670 --> 00:15:46,820
At the very least, that's what we're led to believe.

135
00:15:48,360 --> 00:15:49,370
But it's such a small tunnel.

136
00:15:49,910 --> 00:15:50,890
No one could possibly enter.

137
00:15:52,120 --> 00:15:52,490
Master,

138
00:15:52,910 --> 00:15:53,850
I heard

139
00:15:54,080 --> 00:15:55,220
that in ancient times, there was a contraption

140
00:15:55,480 --> 00:15:57,130
whose entrance was very narrow.

141
00:15:57,910 --> 00:15:59,060
Only a child

142
00:15:59,080 --> 00:16:00,370
could get in to decipher it.

143
00:16:02,960 --> 00:16:03,650
Give me the list of missing persons.

144
00:16:16,000 --> 00:16:16,940
There is a child.

145
00:16:17,440 --> 00:16:18,940
Master, I'll have this wall demolished now.

146
00:16:19,300 --> 00:16:20,130
Wait.

147
00:16:23,720 --> 00:16:24,980
Hide it underground,

148
00:16:25,480 --> 00:16:27,420
and it shall be as resilient as the universe.

149
00:16:28,030 --> 00:16:29,220
Hide it underwater,

150
00:16:29,640 --> 00:16:31,780
and it shall withstand a thousand waves.

151
00:16:36,350 --> 00:16:37,370
It's a pebble and lime wall.

152
00:16:38,510 --> 00:16:39,610
It'll take six months to dig through it.

153
00:16:39,630 --> 00:16:40,690
We can't brute-force it.

154
00:16:48,840 --> 00:16:49,820
Bring Eighth Master here.

155
00:16:50,270 --> 00:16:50,730
Master.

156
00:16:51,480 --> 00:16:52,730
You're not on good terms with him.

157
00:16:53,320 --> 00:16:54,060
Will he come?

158
00:16:54,270 --> 00:16:54,850
Just go.

159
00:16:55,550 --> 00:16:55,940
Yes.

160
00:16:56,750 --> 00:16:57,220
Wait.

161
00:16:59,150 --> 00:17:00,820
He probably knows I'll look for him.

162
00:17:01,720 --> 00:17:02,890
So he is already on the run.

163
00:17:04,750 --> 00:17:05,290
Understood.

164
00:17:09,660 --> 00:17:11,980
[Challenge Fate]

165
00:17:23,140 --> 00:17:25,660
[Qi Tiezui, Qi Clan of the Mystic Nine]

166
00:17:42,640 --> 00:17:43,140
Oh, no.

167
00:17:44,070 --> 00:17:44,770
Master Zhang?

168
00:17:59,720 --> 00:18:00,330
Stop.

169
00:18:19,880 --> 00:18:20,330
Sir.

170
00:18:20,720 --> 00:18:22,490
We have to bury the deceased.

171
00:18:23,960 --> 00:18:24,570
How did he die?

172
00:18:25,440 --> 00:18:26,660
He died from the plague.

173
00:18:26,830 --> 00:18:27,980
We have to bury him outside the city.

174
00:18:43,240 --> 00:18:43,890
Let them through.

175
00:18:43,890 --> 00:18:44,660
Let them through!

176
00:18:44,960 --> 00:18:45,380
Go.

177
00:19:09,960 --> 00:19:11,050
What is going on?

178
00:19:13,110 --> 00:19:14,730
Help!

179
00:19:15,110 --> 00:19:17,140
Help!

180
00:19:37,070 --> 00:19:37,980
Master Zhang?

181
00:19:38,350 --> 00:19:39,290
What are you doing here?

182
00:19:43,000 --> 00:19:44,010
Am I in the afterlife?

183
00:19:47,000 --> 00:19:48,290
Are you dead too?

184
00:19:52,350 --> 00:19:53,380
You have no idea.

185
00:19:53,640 --> 00:19:54,180
Today,

186
00:19:54,640 --> 00:19:56,290
I had an excruciating chest pain.

187
00:19:56,920 --> 00:19:58,980
It was hard to breathe and I...

188
00:20:00,270 --> 00:20:01,290
Master Zhang!

189
00:20:03,160 --> 00:20:04,140
Someone lured me here

190
00:20:04,270 --> 00:20:05,490
so that I could discover this place.

191
00:20:06,070 --> 00:20:07,530
Unit 401 might be inside.

192
00:20:07,830 --> 00:20:08,700
You know contraptions well.

193
00:20:09,000 --> 00:20:09,940
Tell us what you see.

194
00:20:10,510 --> 00:20:12,100
Then, we'll bury you properly.

195
00:20:12,110 --> 00:20:13,370
But I...

196
00:20:13,640 --> 00:20:14,050
Speak.

197
00:20:26,830 --> 00:20:27,800
Pianzuo laying method?

198
00:20:28,920 --> 00:20:32,050
It's taller and narrower than the old bricks in Changsha.

199
00:20:33,400 --> 00:20:34,420
But the bricks are not that old.

200
00:20:34,480 --> 00:20:35,620
Hardly a century old.

201
00:20:35,920 --> 00:20:36,860
But in the past century,

202
00:20:36,920 --> 00:20:38,140
who would build such a high wall?

203
00:20:38,270 --> 00:20:39,860
Only the Qin people can do this.

204
00:20:39,880 --> 00:20:40,900
The bricks intersect

205
00:20:41,000 --> 00:20:41,660
with each other,

206
00:20:41,670 --> 00:20:42,460
but they are not symmetrical.

207
00:20:42,510 --> 00:20:43,460
3:7 split.

208
00:20:43,590 --> 00:20:44,530
1:9 split.

209
00:20:44,590 --> 00:20:45,570
2:8 split.

210
00:20:55,070 --> 00:20:56,380
Master Zhang, look.

211
00:21:00,680 --> 00:21:03,140
You cannot demolish this wall.

212
00:21:03,510 --> 00:21:04,490
This is a xingxiu seal.

213
00:21:04,830 --> 00:21:07,370
Each brick is carefully placed.

214
00:21:07,440 --> 00:21:08,660
Take one out

215
00:21:08,660 --> 00:21:10,520
and the entire wall will collapse.

216
00:21:11,960 --> 00:21:13,220
What does a xingxiu seal mean?

217
00:21:13,440 --> 00:21:16,330
It means this is not a tomb.

218
00:21:16,680 --> 00:21:17,700
It's a living house.

219
00:21:23,000 --> 00:21:23,810
Wait.

220
00:21:25,270 --> 00:21:27,090
Someone is living behind the wall?

221
00:21:27,640 --> 00:21:28,420
Impossible.

222
00:21:29,270 --> 00:21:30,860
Who can possibly live underneath Changsha?

223
00:21:31,200 --> 00:21:32,660
But that's what the wall says.

224
00:21:33,720 --> 00:21:35,810
Master Zhang, the house behind this wall

225
00:21:36,110 --> 00:21:37,330
is a living place.

226
00:21:37,510 --> 00:21:38,290
Who stays inside?

227
00:21:38,640 --> 00:21:40,140
They brought Unit 401 in.

228
00:21:40,640 --> 00:21:42,570
Why would they need soldiers, doctors, and nurses?

229
00:21:44,640 --> 00:21:45,420
Is anyone in there?

230
00:21:46,110 --> 00:21:47,810
Come out and let's talk.

231
00:21:48,030 --> 00:21:50,050
This is a peculiar matter.

232
00:21:50,070 --> 00:21:50,810
Eighth Master.

233
00:21:51,240 --> 00:21:52,900
Please tell us how to solve the contraption on the wall.

234
00:21:53,680 --> 00:21:54,490
Show him the way.

235
00:22:05,400 --> 00:22:06,730
If you can hear me,

236
00:22:07,270 --> 00:22:08,530
please open the wall

237
00:22:09,000 --> 00:22:09,810
and let us in.

238
00:22:11,720 --> 00:22:13,010
We can talk.

239
00:22:13,750 --> 00:22:14,380
Is anyone in there?

240
00:22:15,440 --> 00:22:16,140
Is anyone in there?

241
00:22:22,440 --> 00:22:22,900
Eighth Master.

242
00:22:23,510 --> 00:22:25,180
How do we solve the contraption here?

243
00:22:25,350 --> 00:22:26,460
When are you going to crawl inside?

244
00:22:26,920 --> 00:22:27,900
I can't crawl inside.

245
00:22:28,220 --> 00:22:30,010
Master Zhang asked me to explain the contraption,

246
00:22:30,090 --> 00:22:31,380
not solve it.

247
00:22:31,720 --> 00:22:32,770
Don't you know spells?

248
00:22:33,270 --> 00:22:33,860
Shut up.

249
00:22:34,920 --> 00:22:36,290
Don't waste our time, Eighth Master.

250
00:22:36,750 --> 00:22:38,900
Maybe you don't know how to solve it. You're just buying time.

251
00:22:40,510 --> 00:22:42,620
I know someone who can.

252
00:22:43,310 --> 00:22:43,770
Who?

253
00:22:45,480 --> 00:22:46,460
Quit being mysterious.

254
00:22:46,480 --> 00:22:47,090
Just tell us already.

255
00:22:48,590 --> 00:22:49,900
Wu Laogou.

256
00:22:57,270 --> 00:22:58,330
Fifth Master of the Mystic Nine?

257
00:22:58,830 --> 00:22:59,770
How will he crawl in?

258
00:23:00,810 --> 00:23:02,530
He can't.

259
00:23:03,070 --> 00:23:04,940
But his dog can.

260
00:23:06,880 --> 00:23:08,140
Since this concerns the Zhang Clan,

261
00:23:08,920 --> 00:23:09,940
he probably won't help.

262
00:23:11,480 --> 00:23:13,050
Wu Laogou will just be a nuisance anyway.

263
00:23:13,440 --> 00:23:14,250
If a human can't fit inside,

264
00:23:14,480 --> 00:23:14,980
a dog can't either.

265
00:23:15,720 --> 00:23:17,980
I see you don't know anything about his dog.

266
00:23:18,350 --> 00:23:19,620
His dog

267
00:23:19,850 --> 00:23:21,570
is not an ordinary dog.

268
00:23:22,000 --> 00:23:22,860
How so?

269
00:23:23,830 --> 00:23:24,900
Zhang Xiaojin, you just came back,

270
00:23:24,960 --> 00:23:25,770
so you might not know this.

271
00:23:26,310 --> 00:23:28,090
Five years ago in Changsha City,

272
00:23:28,110 --> 00:23:30,220
there was a once-in-a-century storm in Changsha City.

273
00:23:30,550 --> 00:23:32,570
The Xiang River rose tremendously.

274
00:23:32,570 --> 00:23:33,250
Check that place.

275
00:23:33,440 --> 00:23:35,010
- Many houses - Quick.

276
00:23:35,030 --> 00:23:36,840
- collapsed - You two, go up there.

277
00:23:36,840 --> 00:23:38,960
- because of the rain.
- You two, go there.

278
00:23:39,160 --> 00:23:39,960
There's a survivor here.

279
00:23:40,070 --> 00:23:42,900
- Wu Laogou's brother, Wu Tie,
- Are you there? Make a sound!

280
00:23:42,920 --> 00:23:44,290
[Wu Tie, Wu Laogou's Elder Brother]
- brought his men and dogs - Hello?

281
00:23:44,790 --> 00:23:46,180
to rescue survivors tirelessly.

282
00:23:46,350 --> 00:23:47,530
Wherever a dog barks,

283
00:23:47,640 --> 00:23:48,420
it means someone is there.

284
00:23:51,480 --> 00:23:52,290
Wake up, my friend.

285
00:23:55,310 --> 00:23:55,940
Later,

286
00:23:56,480 --> 00:23:58,140
a landslide cut across the mountain path.

287
00:23:58,510 --> 00:23:59,460
The food supplies couldn't come in.

288
00:24:00,030 --> 00:24:00,570
Unexpectedly, the starving villagers

289
00:24:00,590 --> 00:24:02,180
- killed the dogs - Doggie.

290
00:24:02,240 --> 00:24:04,250
- who saved them to feed themselves.
- Doggie.

291
00:24:14,380 --> 00:24:15,160
[Peaceful Years]

292
00:24:15,160 --> 00:24:16,330
The offender, Wu Tie,

293
00:24:16,550 --> 00:24:17,530
committed homicide.

294
00:24:18,160 --> 00:24:20,810
He will be given the death penalty in accordance with Section 282

295
00:24:20,960 --> 00:24:22,290
of the Criminal Code (of the Republic of China).

296
00:24:22,510 --> 00:24:23,530
He will be executed immediately.

297
00:24:26,110 --> 00:24:26,660
Stop!

298
00:24:39,220 --> 00:24:43,660
[Wu Laogou, from Wu Clan of the Mystic Nine]

299
00:24:44,510 --> 00:24:45,090
Laogou.

300
00:25:08,830 --> 00:25:10,140
Zhang Qishan!

301
00:25:16,000 --> 00:25:16,770
Anyway,

302
00:25:16,770 --> 00:25:17,570
let's drop it.

303
00:25:17,720 --> 00:25:18,640
Regardless,

304
00:25:18,880 --> 00:25:19,530
Fifth Master

305
00:25:19,720 --> 00:25:21,530
will not help you out here.

306
00:25:32,160 --> 00:25:33,220
Master Zhang.

307
00:25:33,960 --> 00:25:36,050
I totally get your message.

308
00:25:37,070 --> 00:25:37,620
I'll go.

309
00:25:38,030 --> 00:25:39,620
I'll convince Fifth Master.

310
00:25:42,550 --> 00:25:43,570
I'll go right now.

311
00:25:43,590 --> 00:25:43,940
Wait.

312
00:25:45,240 --> 00:25:46,010
You've been talking so much

313
00:25:46,270 --> 00:25:47,490
that your legs must be sore.

314
00:25:47,790 --> 00:25:48,490
We'll send you back

315
00:25:49,310 --> 00:25:50,050
the way you came in.

316
00:25:51,160 --> 00:25:51,770
Are we there yet?

317
00:25:52,750 --> 00:25:53,570
[Wu's Residence]
Let me out!

318
00:25:53,920 --> 00:25:54,860
[Wu's Residence]
Let me out now!

319
00:25:56,680 --> 00:25:57,290
Is anyone there?

320
00:25:58,240 --> 00:25:59,460
Come out now, prick.

321
00:25:59,480 --> 00:26:00,380
How dare you put

322
00:26:01,030 --> 00:26:02,940
a coffin before the Wu's Residence?

323
00:26:03,310 --> 00:26:04,220
Take it away now.

324
00:26:04,560 --> 00:26:05,380
Don't!

325
00:26:05,400 --> 00:26:06,900
Don't take it away.

326
00:26:07,160 --> 00:26:07,940
It's me.

327
00:26:08,390 --> 00:26:09,490
Tiezui.

328
00:26:10,030 --> 00:26:10,530
Juanlian.

329
00:26:10,530 --> 00:26:11,240
[Wu Tianpeng, Wu Clan's Mason]

330
00:26:11,240 --> 00:26:11,810
It's Eighth Master.

331
00:26:11,810 --> 00:26:12,860
[Wu Juanlian, Wu Clan's Superintendent]

332
00:26:13,590 --> 00:26:14,460
Oh, my friends,

333
00:26:14,640 --> 00:26:16,050
please tell your master

334
00:26:16,590 --> 00:26:17,620
that I'm here, and I'm Laogou.

335
00:26:17,880 --> 00:26:19,380
And let me out now.

336
00:26:19,880 --> 00:26:20,420
Eighth Master.

337
00:26:20,830 --> 00:26:21,660
It's not up to us

338
00:26:21,880 --> 00:26:23,220
to release you.

339
00:26:23,310 --> 00:26:24,330
If you want to be free,

340
00:26:24,640 --> 00:26:26,290
you'll have to wait for my master to be here.

341
00:26:26,750 --> 00:26:27,620
What?

342
00:26:28,110 --> 00:26:29,940
When did this ever become a rule in your clan?

343
00:26:30,030 --> 00:26:31,140
Go tell your master that Master Zhang

344
00:26:31,270 --> 00:26:32,490
forced me to talk to him.

345
00:26:32,510 --> 00:26:33,220
I didn't want to be here either.

346
00:26:33,270 --> 00:26:34,220
I was coerced.

347
00:26:34,590 --> 00:26:36,290
An odd event often foretells the arrival of an omen.

348
00:26:37,480 --> 00:26:38,810
Zhang Qishan is definitely

349
00:26:38,830 --> 00:26:39,940
up to no good.

350
00:26:42,920 --> 00:26:44,570
He placed you in front of my residence.

351
00:26:46,270 --> 00:26:47,530
That's fishy.

352
00:26:50,160 --> 00:26:50,730
Laogou.

353
00:26:51,510 --> 00:26:53,050
Remember what you promised me

354
00:26:53,070 --> 00:26:53,690
when I cleared up your mess

355
00:26:53,690 --> 00:26:54,460
last year?

356
00:26:55,310 --> 00:26:56,250
I now want you

357
00:26:56,510 --> 00:26:57,420
to get me out of here.

358
00:26:59,200 --> 00:27:00,050
You want to get out?

359
00:27:02,240 --> 00:27:02,900
Sure.

360
00:27:03,350 --> 00:27:05,660
The lid is not fastened anyway. Don't play the victim now.

361
00:27:06,960 --> 00:27:08,940
Fifth Master, get it away from me.

362
00:27:09,050 --> 00:27:09,700
Fifth Master!

363
00:27:11,880 --> 00:27:12,940
Fifth Master!

364
00:27:13,310 --> 00:27:14,460
Get it away from me!

365
00:27:15,670 --> 00:27:16,380
Xiaozhu.

366
00:27:23,750 --> 00:27:24,530
I almost died there.

367
00:27:28,350 --> 00:27:29,050
Xiaozhu.

368
00:27:29,790 --> 00:27:31,010
Watch Eighth Master's feet.

369
00:27:31,880 --> 00:27:33,050
If he leaves the coffin,

370
00:27:33,480 --> 00:27:34,220
bite him to death.

371
00:27:35,720 --> 00:27:36,330
Laogou.

372
00:27:36,480 --> 00:27:37,570
You're being really disloyal.

373
00:27:37,930 --> 00:27:38,570
Tiezui.

374
00:27:39,550 --> 00:27:40,810
If you were in trouble today,

375
00:27:41,400 --> 00:27:43,140
I would save you without any hesitation.

376
00:27:44,830 --> 00:27:46,940
But you are on Master Zhang's side.

377
00:27:47,880 --> 00:27:49,090
And that broke my heart.

378
00:27:49,830 --> 00:27:51,530
I failed to kill him, but killing you is easy.

379
00:27:51,960 --> 00:27:53,070
What were you thinking? Seriously.

380
00:27:53,070 --> 00:27:53,620
Laogou.

381
00:27:54,110 --> 00:27:55,180
I was forced.

382
00:27:55,590 --> 00:27:56,380
Master Zhang said

383
00:27:56,720 --> 00:27:57,810
that if you could assist him,

384
00:27:58,030 --> 00:27:59,220
he could do anything for you.

385
00:28:03,200 --> 00:28:04,050
Sure.

386
00:28:04,920 --> 00:28:06,570
I only want Zhang Qishan dead.

387
00:28:08,400 --> 00:28:09,620
That's too much to ask for.

388
00:28:10,480 --> 00:28:12,090
After he took over Changsha,

389
00:28:12,480 --> 00:28:13,730
this place has become more peaceful.

390
00:28:14,590 --> 00:28:15,490
He cleared out

391
00:28:15,550 --> 00:28:16,730
all the Japanese agents, didn't he?

392
00:28:17,110 --> 00:28:18,330
His merit makes up for his wrongdoing.

393
00:28:19,200 --> 00:28:20,090
Let's just

394
00:28:20,400 --> 00:28:21,530
bury the hatchet.

395
00:28:24,830 --> 00:28:25,900
You're right.

396
00:28:28,720 --> 00:28:29,180
Laogou.

397
00:28:30,750 --> 00:28:31,490
Let me kill you first.

398
00:28:32,720 --> 00:28:34,330
Then, I'll clean up your house.

399
00:28:34,830 --> 00:28:35,620
That way,

400
00:28:36,680 --> 00:28:38,290
my merit makes up for my wrongdoing, and we're even.

401
00:28:39,000 --> 00:28:39,770
Juanlian, Tianpeng.

402
00:28:39,920 --> 00:28:40,420
Yes, Master.

403
00:28:40,790 --> 00:28:42,420
If Eighth Master does not comply,

404
00:28:42,590 --> 00:28:43,730
set up a pot.

405
00:28:44,160 --> 00:28:45,290
Give the dogs an extra meal.

406
00:28:45,550 --> 00:28:46,010
Steam him?

407
00:28:46,030 --> 00:28:46,530
Or braise him?

408
00:28:47,110 --> 00:28:47,810
It won't come to that.

409
00:28:47,960 --> 00:28:48,810
Please don't, my friends.

410
00:28:48,920 --> 00:28:49,530
Don't do that.

411
00:28:51,720 --> 00:28:52,460
Come on.

412
00:28:53,310 --> 00:28:54,420
Look at you.

413
00:28:54,640 --> 00:28:56,330
Stop threatening to kill people.

414
00:28:56,790 --> 00:28:57,490
I did come

415
00:28:57,920 --> 00:28:59,620
with a great offer.

416
00:29:00,070 --> 00:29:01,380
Why don't you hear me out first

417
00:29:01,440 --> 00:29:02,700
before eating me?

418
00:29:02,790 --> 00:29:03,330
Okay?

419
00:29:06,310 --> 00:29:08,570
You're so dedicated to Zhang Qishan's cause today.

420
00:29:09,270 --> 00:29:10,460
Whose side are you on?

421
00:29:11,750 --> 00:29:13,220
Your side, of course, Fifth Master.

422
00:29:13,550 --> 00:29:14,380
Zhang Qishan...

423
00:29:16,310 --> 00:29:17,620
Zhang Qishan is nothing.

424
00:29:21,960 --> 00:29:22,900
Did you hear that?

425
00:29:24,160 --> 00:29:25,570
Insulting the Defense Commander of Changsha

426
00:29:25,590 --> 00:29:27,090
in public.

427
00:29:27,200 --> 00:29:28,140
- No. - The audacity!

428
00:29:28,160 --> 00:29:28,620
No.

429
00:29:28,720 --> 00:29:29,090
Come.

430
00:29:29,510 --> 00:29:30,490
Put him back in the coffin.

431
00:29:30,790 --> 00:29:32,530
We'll blanch out the filth, fry everything, and eat it.

432
00:29:32,680 --> 00:29:33,250
- Yes! - Yes!

433
00:29:33,640 --> 00:29:35,010
Don't!

434
00:29:35,030 --> 00:29:35,490
Fifth Master!

435
00:29:35,510 --> 00:29:35,900
Fifth Master!

436
00:29:36,350 --> 00:29:37,620
Master Zhang tried to kill me.

437
00:29:37,640 --> 00:29:38,490
And now you too?

438
00:29:38,680 --> 00:29:40,570
Can you two please spare me?

439
00:29:40,680 --> 00:29:41,220
Spare you?

440
00:29:44,270 --> 00:29:45,770
You know very well what happened

441
00:29:46,310 --> 00:29:47,180
back then.

442
00:29:49,510 --> 00:29:50,490
Do you think I'll ever help

443
00:29:50,510 --> 00:29:51,420
Zhang Qishan?

444
00:29:57,510 --> 00:29:58,250
About that matter,

445
00:29:58,960 --> 00:30:00,420
Master Zhang had no choice but to do what he did.

446
00:30:01,160 --> 00:30:02,730
He is the Defense Commander of Changsha.

447
00:30:03,270 --> 00:30:04,730
What do you expect him to do?

448
00:30:05,440 --> 00:30:06,490
What if it was his family on the line?

449
00:30:10,160 --> 00:30:11,490
Laogou, you see.

450
00:30:11,720 --> 00:30:13,700
You and he need to meet up and talk this out.

451
00:30:14,510 --> 00:30:16,180
He has changed a lot over these years.

452
00:30:16,310 --> 00:30:18,250
And this time,

453
00:30:18,270 --> 00:30:19,700
hundreds of lives are at stake.

454
00:30:20,640 --> 00:30:21,860
Hundreds.

455
00:30:22,480 --> 00:30:23,530
Think it over.

456
00:30:34,550 --> 00:30:35,290
Laogou.

457
00:30:36,770 --> 00:30:37,610
Stay

458
00:30:38,200 --> 00:30:39,050
out of this.

459
00:30:41,720 --> 00:30:43,700
Ask Zhang Qishan to negotiate with me in person.

460
00:30:44,510 --> 00:30:45,050
Fifth Master.

461
00:30:45,790 --> 00:30:48,010
Do we have a deal?

462
00:30:48,550 --> 00:30:49,620
We have a deal.

463
00:30:49,960 --> 00:30:50,900
A deal is a deal!

464
00:31:03,550 --> 00:31:04,660
Judging from the color

465
00:31:05,200 --> 00:31:06,810
of these underground bricks, they're no more than 80 years old.

466
00:31:07,720 --> 00:31:09,250
A basalt brick

467
00:31:09,720 --> 00:31:11,090
mixed with gold threads during molding

468
00:31:11,110 --> 00:31:11,900
to increase its strength.

469
00:31:12,960 --> 00:31:13,530
This kind of brick

470
00:31:14,070 --> 00:31:15,810
can't be produced by ordinary kilns at all.

471
00:31:16,310 --> 00:31:17,810
There must be a huge kiln factory nearby.

472
00:31:18,720 --> 00:31:19,140
Master,

473
00:31:19,880 --> 00:31:22,050
I have gone through all major kiln factories around Changsha.

474
00:31:22,790 --> 00:31:24,090
Only five factories fit the criteria.

475
00:31:24,350 --> 00:31:26,250
They are Fayuan, Tianxin,

476
00:31:26,350 --> 00:31:27,460
Liuyang, Xiangtan,

477
00:31:27,550 --> 00:31:28,530
and Hengyang.

478
00:31:30,310 --> 00:31:32,420
The making of basalt will release

479
00:31:32,640 --> 00:31:33,900
a lot of smoke.

480
00:31:34,590 --> 00:31:36,570
So the factory will not be in the city

481
00:31:36,960 --> 00:31:38,940
or in the mountains where transportation is difficult.

482
00:31:40,640 --> 00:31:41,180
Then...

483
00:31:43,680 --> 00:31:44,620
Let's visit Liuyang Kiln.

484
00:31:45,740 --> 00:31:50,060
[Liuyang Kiln]

485
00:32:08,960 --> 00:32:09,490
Master,

486
00:32:10,270 --> 00:32:11,460
this should be where they made

487
00:32:11,480 --> 00:32:12,700
the gold thread basalt bricks.

488
00:32:29,550 --> 00:32:30,220
Master.

489
00:32:41,200 --> 00:32:41,860
Master.

490
00:32:42,270 --> 00:32:43,730
This was once a kiln.

491
00:32:44,000 --> 00:32:45,290
But during our investigation,

492
00:32:45,550 --> 00:32:47,660
we discovered that there was another wall inside.

493
00:32:48,240 --> 00:32:49,700
They might be hiding

494
00:32:49,720 --> 00:32:50,860
something illegal inside.

495
00:33:22,790 --> 00:33:23,290
Master.

496
00:33:24,070 --> 00:33:25,570
These were probably the kiln workers.

497
00:33:25,960 --> 00:33:27,140
They were all killed.

498
00:33:45,280 --> 00:33:46,290
They all killed themselves.

499
00:34:03,560 --> 00:34:04,730
They did not hesitate either.

500
00:34:06,110 --> 00:34:07,560
The cultists probably were told

501
00:34:07,560 --> 00:34:09,420
that they would be rewarded after death.

502
00:34:10,550 --> 00:34:12,340
They formed the taiji diagram with their bodies.

503
00:34:13,590 --> 00:34:16,170
What a fanatical ritual.

504
00:34:32,800 --> 00:34:34,490
Karma will uncover itself.

505
00:34:36,960 --> 00:34:38,490
My Sovereign awaits you.

506
00:34:40,670 --> 00:34:41,210
Master.

507
00:34:41,880 --> 00:34:43,090
What does "My Sovereign" mean?

508
00:34:43,920 --> 00:34:46,690
It might have something to do with the cult.

509
00:34:47,190 --> 00:34:47,900
It seems like

510
00:34:48,630 --> 00:34:50,300
the one who had built the huge underground wall

511
00:34:51,000 --> 00:34:53,610
already knew we would investigate and trace it here.

512
00:34:54,280 --> 00:34:55,380
[Karma will uncover itself.]
So they deliberately left these messages

513
00:34:55,380 --> 00:34:56,230
[My Sovereign awaits you.]

514
00:34:56,230 --> 00:34:57,300
to taunt us.

515
00:34:57,440 --> 00:34:59,740
They sure are bold.

516
00:35:01,670 --> 00:35:02,170
Master.

517
00:35:02,800 --> 00:35:03,340
Master.

518
00:35:03,880 --> 00:35:04,650
Eighth Master Qi said

519
00:35:04,840 --> 00:35:05,900
that Wu Laogou agreed to meet up.

520
00:35:11,960 --> 00:35:14,690
- Bravo! - Bravo!

521
00:35:15,710 --> 00:35:16,170
Well played!

522
00:35:16,440 --> 00:35:17,340
- Bravo. - Very nice.

523
00:35:17,760 --> 00:35:19,780
- Bravo! - Bravo!

524
00:35:19,920 --> 00:35:20,490
What a play!

525
00:35:30,000 --> 00:35:32,740
- Bravo! - Bravo!

526
00:35:34,520 --> 00:35:35,150
Impressive.

527
00:35:35,200 --> 00:35:35,580
Let's go.

528
00:35:36,820 --> 00:35:39,560
[Pear Garden]

529
00:35:39,560 --> 00:35:41,620
Master, aren't you going to finish it?

530
00:35:42,150 --> 00:35:44,580
Why must we always leave during this act?

531
00:35:46,030 --> 00:35:47,740
The monkey will be captured next.

532
00:35:48,190 --> 00:35:49,090
I don't like the ending.

533
00:35:50,000 --> 00:35:51,690
The monkey made a mess.

534
00:35:51,910 --> 00:35:52,660
Shouldn't it be captured?

535
00:35:53,590 --> 00:35:55,370
The Jade Emperor and his immortals

536
00:35:55,390 --> 00:35:56,410
only cared about the persecution.

537
00:35:56,910 --> 00:35:57,940
They never once asked why

538
00:35:58,390 --> 00:36:00,340
the monkey made a mess in the first place.

539
00:36:04,320 --> 00:36:05,210
That's because the monkey did not like

540
00:36:05,400 --> 00:36:06,940
the rules set by the immortals.

541
00:36:08,150 --> 00:36:09,180
Bad rules

542
00:36:10,110 --> 00:36:11,180
need to be amended.

543
00:36:11,750 --> 00:36:14,050
Master, are you meeting with Zhang Qishan for real?

544
00:36:16,280 --> 00:36:17,730
I have a bad hunch about it.

545
00:36:18,600 --> 00:36:20,260
This must be a trap he set up.

546
00:36:20,880 --> 00:36:21,980
A journey to the West.

547
00:36:22,360 --> 00:36:23,860
And my journey has gone on long enough.

548
00:36:24,920 --> 00:36:26,160
It seems like Zhang Qishan's ego

549
00:36:27,110 --> 00:36:28,940
has soared higher than the sky.

550
00:36:29,590 --> 00:36:30,980
He clearly knows I hate him so much,

551
00:36:33,150 --> 00:36:34,420
but he still asks for my help.

552
00:36:35,400 --> 00:36:36,380
Juanlian. Tianpeng.

553
00:36:37,230 --> 00:36:40,010
The time to turn everything upside down will soon be upon us.

554
00:36:56,860 --> 00:37:01,020
♪The past fades like smoke♪

555
00:37:01,380 --> 00:37:04,100
♪A choice is made in silence♪

556
00:37:04,380 --> 00:37:07,180
♪In this labyrinthine puzzle♪

557
00:37:07,580 --> 00:37:11,340
♪Who can reach the shore?♪

558
00:37:11,580 --> 00:37:15,020
♪Just an ordinary farewell♪

559
00:37:15,300 --> 00:37:18,700
♪The sun seems to shine bright over our heads♪

560
00:37:18,780 --> 00:37:26,060
♪But this could be our last trip together♪

561
00:37:26,500 --> 00:37:29,780
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

562
00:37:30,060 --> 00:37:33,300
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

563
00:37:33,460 --> 00:37:37,500
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

564
00:37:37,700 --> 00:37:41,060
♪Who believes in fate?♪

565
00:37:41,300 --> 00:37:44,660
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

566
00:37:44,900 --> 00:37:48,180
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

567
00:37:48,500 --> 00:37:52,180
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

568
00:37:52,380 --> 00:37:55,620
♪Take care♪

569
00:37:55,620 --> 00:37:58,180
♪We once raced♪

570
00:37:58,260 --> 00:38:00,180
♪For the dawn♪

571
00:38:00,340 --> 00:38:03,620
♪Ever-lasting bond, a satisfying vindication♪

572
00:38:03,740 --> 00:38:07,020
♪In the web of fate♪

573
00:38:07,020 --> 00:38:10,220
♪No one can escape♪

574
00:38:11,220 --> 00:38:13,060
♪Life and death cut like a blade♪

575
00:38:13,220 --> 00:38:14,780
♪We too were young once♪

576
00:38:14,860 --> 00:38:18,300
♪Fortunate to brave the raging waves together♪

577
00:38:18,500 --> 00:38:20,820
♪Keep the ember lit♪

578
00:38:20,940 --> 00:38:25,460
♪To illuminate the journey ahead♪

579
00:38:25,580 --> 00:38:28,540
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

580
00:38:28,780 --> 00:38:32,300
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

581
00:38:32,420 --> 00:38:36,180
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

582
00:38:36,500 --> 00:38:39,980
♪Who believes in fate?♪

583
00:38:40,140 --> 00:38:43,140
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

584
00:38:43,380 --> 00:38:47,140
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

585
00:38:47,300 --> 00:38:51,020
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

586
00:38:51,140 --> 00:39:02,580
♪Please, do take care of yourself♪
